     "text": "짜증내는 외국인이 있는데요, 얼굴에 한번 써보더니",
     "speaker": "S1",
     "lang": "ko",
     "kind": "narration"
    },
    {
     "start": 5.1,
     "end": 6.3,
     "text": "How do people do this?",
     "speaker": "S2",
     "lang": "en",
     "kind": "source"
    },
    {
     "start": 6.3,
     "end": 8.1,
     "text": "생각대로 안 발리던 것인데요,",
     "speaker": "S1",
     "lang": "ko",
     "kind": "narration"
    },
    {
     "start": 8.1,
     "end": 10.0,
     "text": "Doing something wrong. Don't understand",
     "speaker": "S2",
     "lang": "en",
     "kind": "source"
    },
    {
     "start": 10.0,
     "end": 14.1,
     "text": "일단 블렌딩하며 마무리까지 해주더니",
     "speaker": "S1",
     "lang": "ko",
     "kind": "narration"
    },
    {
     "start": 12.3,
     "end": 15.3,
     "text": "emphasizing pores on my skin, just looks a little bit dry and patchy",
     "speaker": "S2",
     "lang": "en",
     "kind": "source"
    },
    {
     "start": 15.3,
     "end": 18.2,
     "text": "일본인 여성은 잘 못 사용한 거라면 직접 알려주겠다는데",
     "speaker": "S1",
     "lang": "ko",
     "kind": "narration"
    },
    {
     "start": 16.5,
     "end": 18.2,
     "text": "I'm going to teach you right now.",
     "speaker": "S3",
     "lang": "en",
     "kind": "source"
    },
    {
     "start": 18.8,
     "end": 25.5,
     "text": "Don't press foundation with a spatula. Hold it like this, drag it, and then pull. Layer right on the side",
     "speaker": "S3",
     "lang": "en",
     "kind": "source"
    },
    {
     "start": 25.6,
     "end": 27.2,
     "text": "얼굴에 발라줄 땐",
     "speaker": "S1",
     "lang": "ko",
     "kind": "narration"
    },
    {
     "start": 27.2,
     "end": 29.2,
     "text": "You don't press it down. You hold it like this",
     "speaker": "S3",
     "lang": "en",
     "kind": "source"
    },
    {
     "start": 29.2,
     "end": 31.0,
     "text": "세워서 얇게 펴발라주면",
     "speaker": "S1",
     "lang": "ko",
     "kind": "narration"
    },
    {
     "start": 31.0,
     "end": 32.4,
     "text": "You see this even application?",
     "speaker": "S3",
